      "content": "i get what you're saying but i really think it's just a migraine freakout. i'm feeling super nauseous and my vision is a bit blurry too which is super normal for my migraines. i really just want to lie down in a dark room and forget this happened. if i just take some extra ibuprofen and a couple of my migraine meds together, i should be fine to just pass out and sleep through it, right? it's better than driving in this state.",
